{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "1001", "sample_idx": 32, "model_name": "google/gemma-3n-e2b-it", "content": "Hark gentle traveler to Nippon's shore\nA journey grand awaits and evermore!\n\nFirst to Kyoto we shall make our way\nWhere ancient temples greet the light of day.\nFushimi Inari's gates a vermilion dream\nA thousand torii a vibrant gleam.\nKinkaku-ji's gold a wondrous sight\nReflecting beauty in the morning light.\nGion's district where geishas softly tread\nSecrets whispered words yet to be said.\n\nThen onward to the capital's grace\nTokyo's bustle in this wondrous place.\nThe Imperial Palace a stately show\nWhere history's echoes gently flow.\nSenso-ji Temple a vibrant hue\nWith incense smoke and offerings anew.\nShibuya's crossing a human tide\nA swirling chaos where fortunes hide.\nHarajuku's youth a fashion's art\nA vibrant pulse that sets the soul apart.\n\nFrom Tokyo's heights to Hakone's serene\nA mountain landscape a tranquil scene.\nLake Ashi's beauty a mirror's hold\nWith Mount Fuji's peak in stories told.\nCruise the waters a gentle sway\nWatching clouds drift and softly play.\nHakone Open-Air Museum a wondrous art\nNature's canvas a brand new start.\n\nNara's deer a playful throng\nA friendly welcome all day long.\nTodai-ji's Buddha a giant's might\nA symbol grand of pure delight.\nKasuga Taisha lanterns softly gleam\nA pathway lit in a mystic dream.\n\nThen Osaka's charm a culinary quest\nDotonbori's lights put taste to the test.\nTakoyaki's spheres a savory treat\nOkonomiyaki a flavor complete.\nOsaka Castle a fortress bold\nStories of warriors forever told.\n\nThus ends the journey a tale to impart\nOf Japan's beauty held within the heart.\nMay memories linger and joy reside\nIn Nippon's splendor open wide.\n\n\n\n", "logprobs": [{"token": "H", "logprob": -0.0021908108610659838}, {"token": "ark", "logprob": -1.3947389561508317e-05}, {"token": "▁gentle", "logprob": -0.5696897506713867}, {"token": "▁traveler", "logprob": -0.008129720576107